{"id": "1c8db125-1463-4204-826d-e6b39bf7729b", "slug": "nexus-the-architecture-of-capital", "title": "Nexus — The Architecture of Capital", "description": "Nexus Architecture Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus — The Architecture of Capital\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Architecture Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#60A5FA\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#0F172A\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"24px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus — The Architecture of Capital\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 189; favorites: 10; remixes: 5.\nTags: login, animated, webgl, threejs, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nNexus Architecture Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nNexus Platform Architecture Nodes Protocol Sign In Initialize Core Infrastructure The Architecture of Capital. Deploy decentralized financial primitives with institutional-grade telemetry. A skeuomorphic interface for t…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The Architecture of Capital..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #60A5FA, background #FFFFFF, surface #0F172A, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased selection:bg-blue-500/30 selection:text-blue-200\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus — The Architecture of Capital</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&display=swap');\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #020617;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .font-mono {\n            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n        }\n\n        /* Skeuomorphic Glass Surfaces */\n        .glass-panel {\n            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15),\n                inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),\n                0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* Gradient Highlight Overlay */\n        .glass-panel::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 100%);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Structural Grid Lines */\n        .grid-line-v {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            width: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 80%, transparent);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .grid-line-h {\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            height: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 80%, transparent);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Corner Markers */\n        .corner-marker {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Button Glow */\n        .btn-glow {\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .btn-glow::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -4px;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(59,130,246,0.5), rgba(96,165,250,0.5));\n            filter: blur(12px);\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n        .btn-glow:hover::after {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* Subtle Background Texture */\n        .bg-texture {\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 0, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 10px);\n        }\n\n        /* Soft Glow behind cards */\n        .ambient-glow {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 600px;\n            height: 600px;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59,130,246,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            top: 50%;\n            right: -10%;\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 0;\n            filter: blur(60px);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-texture\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Structural Grid Frame -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full relative\">\n            <!-- Vertical Rails -->\n            <div class=\"grid-line-v left-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-line-v left-1/4 opacity-50\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-line-v left-2/4\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-line-v left-3/4 opacity-50\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-line-v right-0\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Horizontal Rails (Top/Bottom safe areas) -->\n            <div class=\"grid-line-h top-24\"></div>\n            <div class=\"grid-line-h bottom-24\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Frame Corner L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"corner-marker top-0 left-0 border-t border-l\"></div>\n            <div class=\"corner-marker top-0 right-0 border-t border-r\"></div>\n            <div class=\"corner-marker bottom-0 left-0 border-b border-l\"></div>\n            <div class=\"corner-marker bottom-0 right-0 border-b border-r\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12\">\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between h-24 gsap-fade-in\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer group\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full glass-panel flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-blue-400 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(59,130,246,0.6)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight\">Nexus</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Links -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 glass-panel px-8 py-3 rounded-full\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Architecture</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Nodes</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Protocol</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Actions -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden sm:block text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Sign In</a>\n                <button class=\"glass-panel btn-glow rounded-full px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95\">\n                    Initialize\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center py-12 lg:py-0\">\n\n            <!-- Left: Typography & Actions -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start z-20\">\n                <div class=\"gsap-hero-text flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-[1px] bg-blue-500\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-400 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">Core Infrastructure</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"gsap-hero-text text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tighter leading-[1.05] text-white mb-6\">\n                    The Architecture <br/>\n                    <span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-blue-200\">of Capital.</span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"gsap-hero-text text-lg font-light text-slate-400 max-w-md mb-10 leading-relaxed\">\n                    Deploy decentralized financial primitives with institutional-grade telemetry. A skeuomorphic interface for the next iteration of value transfer.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"gsap-hero-text flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-6 w-full sm:w-auto\">\n                    <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_0_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.4)] hover:shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.6)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\">\n                        Deploy Node\n                    </button>\n\n                    <!-- Social Proof -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex -space-x-3\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/0d868fef-f560-45ca-ab35-5dad4fc29059_800w.webp\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-950 object-cover grayscale opacity-80 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all z-30\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/3186f9ea-5f5a-49f7-8fcf-568ad52f515e_800w.webp\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-950 object-cover grayscale opacity-80 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all z-20\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/65695f80-23f9-46ee-8487-cbb6c93cc48b_800w.webp\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-950 object-cover grayscale opacity-80 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all z-10\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-950 bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 z-0\">\n                                +8k\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-300\">Active Operators</span>\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-blue-500/30\">View Telemetry</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right: 3D Floating Skeuomorphic Cards -->\n            <div class=\"relative h-[600px] w-full hidden lg:block z-20 perspective-[2000px]\">\n                <div class=\"ambient-glow\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Card 1 (Top / Lightest) -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-card absolute top-[10%] right-[15%] w-[340px] h-[215px] rounded-[24px] glass-panel p-6 flex flex-col justify-between transform rotate-x-[15deg] rotate-y-[-20deg] rotate-z-[10deg] hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 z-30 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4);\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-6 bg-slate-400/20 rounded flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-colors\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sim-card-linear\" class=\"text-slate-300 text-lg group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:card-2-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Node Address</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-lg font-mono text-slate-200 tracking-widest mb-4\">4A90 8B21 00X1 77F4</div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5\">Valid Thru</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-300\">12/28</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex relative w-8 h-5\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute right-3 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-400/50 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"absolute right-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-300/50 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2 (Middle) -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-card absolute top-[35%] right-[5%] w-[340px] h-[215px] rounded-[24px] glass-panel p-6 flex flex-col justify-between transform rotate-x-[20deg] rotate-y-[-15deg] rotate-z-[0deg] hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 z-20 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(32px);\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-200\">AETHER</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-linear\" class=\"text-blue-400 text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-center my-4\">\n                         <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-slate-500/50 text-5xl group-hover:text-blue-500/40 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-2\">\n                            <span>Hash Rate</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-blue-400\">Optimal</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 tracking-widest\">\n                            0x71C...89A4\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3 (Bottom / Darkest) -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-card absolute top-[55%] right-[25%] w-[340px] h-[215px] rounded-[24px] glass-panel p-6 flex flex-col justify-between transform rotate-x-[25deg] rotate-y-[-10deg] rotate-z-[-10deg] hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 z-10 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.8);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-40 h-40 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-colors\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-end\">\n                             <div class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-500/30 bg-blue-500/10 text-[10px] font-mono text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                 <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                                 Live Sync\n                             </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Contract Execution</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 break-all leading-relaxed\">\n                                function transfer(address _to, uint256 _value) public returns (bool success)\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Background (Three.js) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera setup\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 20;\n            camera.position.y = 5;\n            camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n            // Renderer setup\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\n                canvas: canvas,\n                alpha: true,\n                antialias: true,\n                powerPreference: \"high-performance\"\n            });\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2)); // DPR clamp\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n\n            // Particles (Dot Matrix Grid)\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 2500;\n            const positions = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n            const randomOffsets = new Float32Array(particlesCount); // For staggered pulsing\n\n            // Create a structured but slightly organic grid\n            let i = 0;\n            const spread = 40;\n            for(let x = -spread/2; x < spread/2; x += 1.5) {\n                for(let z = -spread/2; z < spread/2; z += 1.5) {\n                    // Randomly skip some points for a sparser look\n                    if(Math.random() > 0.6 && i < particlesCount * 3) {\n                        positions[i] = x + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5; // slight irregularity\n\n                        // Y height based on distance from center (creates a slight bowl/wave shape)\n                        const dist = Math.sqrt(x*x + z*z);\n                        positions[i+1] = Math.sin(dist * 0.2) * 2 - dist * 0.1;\n\n                        positions[i+2] = z + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n                        randomOffsets[i/3] = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                        i += 3;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\n            geometry.setAttribute('aOffset', new THREE.BufferAttribute(randomOffsets, 1));\n\n            // Custom Shader Material for soft dots and pulse\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: {\n                    uTime: { value: 0 },\n                    uColor: { value: new THREE.Color('#3B82F6') } // Electric Blue\n                },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    uniform float uTime;\n                    attribute float aOffset;\n                    varying float vAlpha;\n\n                    void main() {\n                        vec4 modelPosition = modelMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n\n                        // Slow breathing pulse motion based on position and time\n                        modelPosition.y += sin(uTime * 0.5 + aOffset) * 0.5;\n\n                        vec4 viewPosition = viewMatrix * modelPosition;\n                        vec4 projectedPosition = projectionMatrix * viewPosition;\n                        gl_Position = projectedPosition;\n\n                        // Size attenuation and pulsing size\n                        gl_PointSize = (12.0 + sin(uTime + aOffset) * 4.0) * (1.0 / -viewPosition.z);\n\n                        // Fade alpha based on depth\n                        vAlpha = smoothstep(30.0, 5.0, -viewPosition.z) * 0.6;\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    uniform vec3 uColor;\n                    varying float vAlpha;\n\n                    void main() {\n                        // Create circular dot with soft edge\n                        vec2 cxy = 2.0 * gl_PointCoord - 1.0;\n                        float r = dot(cxy, cxy);\n                        if (r > 1.0) discard;\n\n                        float alpha = (1.0 - r) * vAlpha;\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(uColor, alpha);\n                    }\n                `,\n                transparent: true,\n                depthWrite: false,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particles = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(particles);\n\n            // Interaction state\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - window.innerWidth / 2) * 0.001;\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - window.innerHeight / 2) * 0.001;\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n                material.uniforms.uTime.value = elapsedTime;\n\n                // Subtle pointer drift (Parallax)\n                targetX = mouseX * 2;\n                targetY = mouseY * 2;\n\n                camera.position.x += (targetX - camera.position.x) * 0.02;\n                camera.position.y += (-targetY + 5 - camera.position.y) * 0.02; // Keep base Y at 5\n                camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n                // Very slow rotation of the whole field\n                particles.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n            // Fade in navigation\n            tl.fromTo(\".gsap-fade-in\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: -20 },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, ease: \"power3.out\" }\n            );\n\n            // Stagger hero text\n            tl.fromTo(\".gsap-hero-text\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: 30 },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.15, ease: \"power3.out\" },\n                \"-=0.5\"\n            );\n\n            // Animate Cards entering\n            tl.fromTo(\".gsap-card\",\n                { opacity: 0, x: 100, y: 50, rotateY: 10 },\n                { opacity: 1, x: 0, y: 0, rotateY: (i, el) => el.style.transform.match(/rotate-y-\\[([^\\]]+)\\]/)?.[1] || 0, duration: 1.2, stagger: 0.2, ease: \"expo.out\" },\n                \"-=0.8\"\n            );\n\n            // Continuous floating animation for cards\n            gsap.utils.toArray(\".gsap-card\").forEach((card, i) => {\n                gsap.to(card, {\n                    y: \"+=15\",\n                    rotationZ: \"+=1\",\n                    duration: 3 + i, // different durations to desync\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    delay: i * 0.5\n                });\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize on load\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initGSAP();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-the-architecture-of-capital.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-the-architecture-of-capital.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-the-architecture-of-capital-DESIGN.md", "views": 331, "forks": 11, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T05:09:16.008305+00:00"}